       >>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PAIRMAIN.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WORK-A PIC 9(9)V99.
01 WORK-B PIC 9(9)V99.
01 STATUS-A PIC 99.
01 STATUS-B PIC 99.
LINKAGE SECTION.
01 REQUEST-A.
   05 AMOUNT-A PIC 9(7)V99.
   05 COUNT-A PIC 9(4) COMP-5.
   05 RATE-A PIC 9V99.
01 REQUEST-B.
   05 AMOUNT-B PIC 9(7)V99.
   05 COUNT-B PIC 9(4) COMP-5.
   05 RATE-B PIC 9V99.
01 RESPONSE-A.
   05 OUTPUT-A PIC 9(9)V99.
   05 CODE-A PIC 99.
01 RESPONSE-B.
   05 OUTPUT-B PIC 9(9)V99.
   05 CODE-B PIC 99.
01 TOTAL-AMOUNT PIC 9(10)V99.
01 SUMMARY-STATUS PIC 99.
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING REQUEST-A REQUEST-B
    RESPONSE-A RESPONSE-B TOTAL-AMOUNT SUMMARY-STATUS.
MAIN-ENTRY.
    MOVE ZERO TO WORK-A WORK-B STATUS-A STATUS-B.
    MOVE ZERO TO OUTPUT-A OUTPUT-B CODE-A CODE-B.
    MOVE ZERO TO TOTAL-AMOUNT SUMMARY-STATUS.
    CALL 'CALCWRAP' USING BY CONTENT REQUEST-A
        BY REFERENCE WORK-A STATUS-A
        ON EXCEPTION
            MOVE 91 TO STATUS-A
            MOVE ZERO TO WORK-A
    END-CALL.
    CALL 'CALCWRAP' USING BY CONTENT REQUEST-B
        BY REFERENCE WORK-B STATUS-B
        ON EXCEPTION
            MOVE 91 TO STATUS-B
            MOVE ZERO TO WORK-B
    END-CALL.
    CALL 'RESULTFN' USING BY CONTENT WORK-A STATUS-A
        BY REFERENCE OUTPUT-A CODE-A
        ON EXCEPTION
            MOVE 93 TO CODE-A
            MOVE ZERO TO OUTPUT-A
    END-CALL.
    CALL 'RESULTFN' USING BY CONTENT WORK-B STATUS-B
        BY REFERENCE OUTPUT-B CODE-B
        ON EXCEPTION
            MOVE 93 TO CODE-B
            MOVE ZERO TO OUTPUT-B
    END-CALL.
    CALL 'PAIRJOIN' USING BY CONTENT RESPONSE-A RESPONSE-B
        BY REFERENCE TOTAL-AMOUNT SUMMARY-STATUS
        ON EXCEPTION
            MOVE 94 TO SUMMARY-STATUS
            MOVE ZERO TO TOTAL-AMOUNT
    END-CALL.
    GOBACK.
